    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d156">

                <pb facs="0324" n="228" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg228"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-07"><hi rendition="#italic">October 7,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Chinese Government increased the militia here, insuring present protection.
                    General situation Chinese Empire growing serious. British minister, Russian
                    minister, German minister to-day placed large guards in legations; other
                    ministers have ordered them. I strongly urge presence of small guard at Tientsin
                    at least before navigation closes. May I expect them?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
